{"title":"1972 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_19\">Problem 19</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 19\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> terms of the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/6/3065f3bf2f16630e9301746d4a141351a109e41e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,~(1+2),~(1+2+2^2),~\\dots ~(1+2+2^2+\\dots +2^{n-1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"423\" height=\"19\" /> in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e79e96f4f62321ed594de9bee5173da6013c36f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }2^n\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }2^n-n\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }2^{n+1}-n\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }2^{n+1}-n-2\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }n\\cdot 2^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"586\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We begin by evaluating the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> terms of the sequence with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. We find that the sum of the first term of the sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the sum of the first two terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and the sum of the first three terms <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. From here, we can simply guess and check the answer choices and will find that only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" /> works.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016224442\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 49/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2245/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15033:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016224442 and revision id 291094. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}